---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
import LandingNav from "../../components/LandingNav.astro"
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Showcase — Real-World Apps Built with Ethereal UI"
  description="Explore production SaaS applications and open-source systems built with Ethereal UI, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS v4."
>
  <LandingNav />

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16 space-y-16">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="space-y-4 max-w-3xl">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700 dark:border-blue-500/30 dark:bg-blue-500/10 dark:text-blue-300">
        <span>Community &amp; Production Ecosystem</span>
        <span>&bull;</span>
        <span>Built with Ethereal UI</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
        Showcase
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
        Explore production applications, SaaS platforms, and open-source projects built with Ethereal UI. Real-world proof that Ethereal UI is battle-tested for enterprise workloads.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Featured App Showcase: Ethereal HRMS -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
              Ethereal Enterprise HRMS
            </h2>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/25">
              Production SaaS
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/25">
              Open Source
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-1">
            Complete Human Resource Management System with payroll execution, multi-department roster, attendance, and role-based permissions.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/XenchinRyu7/hrms"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-800 shadow-2xs hover:bg-zinc-50 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-200 dark:hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-colors"
          >
            <svg class="h-4 w-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.53 1.032 1.53 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>View Source on GitHub</span>
          </a>

          <a
            href="https://hrms.saefulrohman.dev"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white shadow-2xs hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Open Live Application</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Preview Device Frame -->
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-950 shadow-xl dark:border-zinc-800">
        <!-- Mock Browser Chrome Bar -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/90 px-4 py-2.5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-500/80"></span>
            <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-amber-500/80"></span>
            <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80"></span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-zinc-950 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-zinc-400">
            <svg class="h-3 w-3 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"/>
              <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/>
            </svg>
            <span>https://hrms.saefulrohman.dev</span>
          </div>

          <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-500 hidden sm:block">
            Production Deployment
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Embedded Interactive Iframe -->
        <div class="relative aspect-16/10 w-full min-h-[580px] bg-zinc-900">
          <iframe
            src="https://hrms.saefulrohman.dev"
            title="Ethereal Enterprise HRMS Live Application"
            class="h-full w-full border-0"
            loading="lazy"
            allow="fullscreen"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tech Stack Badges & Details -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-2">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-4 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/50">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Architecture</span>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mt-1">Astro 5 + React 19 Islands</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-1">Hybrid SSG/SSR rendering with fast page transitions and zero hydration bloat.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-4 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/50">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Design System</span>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mt-1">Ethereal UI + Tailwind v4</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-1">Custom OKLCH theme engine, data tables, dialogs, charts, and metric grids.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-4 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/50">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Features</span>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mt-1">Fullstack SaaS Capabilities</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-1">Employee rosters, payroll execution, expense vouchers, attendance analytics.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Submission CTA -->
    <section class="rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-zinc-300 bg-zinc-50/50 p-8 text-center dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/20">
      <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
          Building something with Ethereal UI?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
          We would love to feature your project in the Ethereal UI Showcase! Whether it is a SaaS platform, internal dashboard, or open-source tool, submit a PR on GitHub.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/XenchinRyu7/Ethereal-UI/issues"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-800 shadow-2xs hover:bg-zinc-50 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 dark:hover:bg-zinc-700 transition-colors"
          >
            Submit Your Project &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
